 {
  "id": 5,
  "slug": "about",
  "link": "https://fernhill.example/about/",
  "title": {
   "rendered": "About &amp; story"
  },
  "content": {
   "rendered": "\n<p>Fernhill Bakery started in a garage with one deck oven and a <strong>very</strong> stubborn starter called Gus.</p>\n<p>Today we bake for the village every morning. Read <a href=\"https://fernhill.example/2025/03/our-first-loaf/\">how it began</a> or download our <a href=\"https://fernhill.example/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/price-list.pdf\">price list</a>.</p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://fernhill.example/classes/\"><img src=\"https://fernhill.example/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/team-1024x768.jpg\" srcset=\"https://fernhill.example/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/team-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://fernhill.example/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/team-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, https://fernhill.example/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/team-300x225.jpg 300w\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1500\" alt=\"The baking team\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a><figcaption>The team on a Saturday morning</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li>Organic flour from Hollow Mill</li><li>Water from our own well</li><li>Salt, time and patience</li></ul>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\"><iframe title=\"Shaping a batard\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/aBcDeFgHiJk?feature=oembed\" allowfullscreen></iframe></div></figure>\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator\"/>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Loaf</th><th>Weight</th><th>Price</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Country</td><td>900 g</td><td>£5.50</td></tr><tr><td>Rye</td><td>750 g</td><td>£5.00</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>Daily loaves</figcaption></figure>\n"
  },
  "excerpt": {
   "rendered": ""
  },
  "parent": 0,
  "menu_order": 1,
  "featured_media": 0,
  "_embedded": {}
 },
 {
